- **STATUS CODE REPORTING THE WRAPPER / check cannot fail**: line 221.  
  Exact input: `python scripts/periprocedural_literature_2026_08_19.py --aply`  
  Consequence: a misspelled apply/check invocation runs the dry-run branch and exits `0`, so automation can report success while doing no work.

